*OpenUI *MediaType/Media Type: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *MediaType
*DefaultMediaType: Plain
*MediaType Plain/Plain Paper: "<</MediaType(Plain)/cupsMediaType 1>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType Light/Light 60-74g: "<</MediaType(Light)/cupsMediaType 258>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType MidWeight/Mid-Weight 96-110g: "<</MediaType(MidWeight)/cupsMediaType 282>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType Heavy/Heavy 111-130g: "<</MediaType(Heavy)/cupsMediaType 262>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType ExtraHeavy/Extra Heavy 131-175g: "<</MediaType(ExtraHeavy)/cupsMediaType 283>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType Transparency/Transparency: "<</MediaType(Transparency)/cupsMediaType 2>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType Labels/Labels: "<</MediaType(Labels)/cupsMediaType 265>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType Envelope/Envelope: "<</MediaType(Envelope)/cupsMediaType 267>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType Letterhead/Letterhead: "<</MediaType(Letterhead)/cupsMediaType 513>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType Recycled/Recycled: "<</MediaType(Recycled)/cupsMediaType 516>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType Rough/Rough: "<</MediaType(Rough)/cupsMediaType 263>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *MediaType

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Gray
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale: "<</cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 3/cupsBitsPerColor 1>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 600dpi/600 DPI: "<</HWResolution[600 600]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*% Copies: the printer makes uncollated copies (ZJI_DMCOPIES); with
*% Collate=True the filter repeats the whole document instead.
*OpenUI *Collate/Collate Copies: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Collate
*DefaultCollate: True
*Collate True/On: "<</Collate true>>setpagedevice"
*Collate False/Off: "<</Collate false>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Collate

*% Density and EconoMode: the filter reads the PPD default and applies the job options.
*OpenUI *Density/Print Density: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Density
*DefaultDensity: 3
*Density 1/1 (Lightest): ""
*Density 2/2: ""
*Density 3/3 (Normal): ""
*Density 4/4: ""
*Density 5/5 (Darkest): ""
*CloseUI: *Density

*OpenUI *EconoMode/EconoMode (Toner Save): Boolean
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *EconoMode
*DefaultEconoMode: False
*EconoMode True/On: ""
*EconoMode False/Off: ""
*CloseUI: *EconoMode

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
*% End of PPD
